    "detailed_description": "Boredom survivor is a &quot;boring&quot; survivor+role-playing game<br>You can pick up handy weapons in the game and use technology and magic to repel monster invasions!<br>Gain growth through battles and collect materials for crafting.<br>You can also explore the secrets of the small town during battles. Can you discover the truth of the small town as a warrior?<br><br>Excellent gameplay experience+extremely complex and diverse skills/items/growth system!<br><br>Multiple adventure professions to choose from, each with its own unique combat style and growth path!<br><br>Dozens of distinctive combat skills, each with a unique strategic advantage, use your understanding to form the strongest combination!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/272e44c9320ad80b69d733ff1c2de064.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=358 /></span><br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><strong>Multiple roles\uff1a</strong><br>Different characters carry different talents, and combine skills and equipment according to your preferences<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/d10022560435cda8f8ab2abb9c3e78bc.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong>Equipment system\uff1a</strong><br>Randomly obtain equipment of various qualities from monsters<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/3cfee4b0afe83fd9632dfc6372df4097.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong>set bonuses\uff1a</strong><br>Collect a large number of different sets to achieve powerful effects<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/1fbd40959a9f7d003ae1281d546ef431.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong>Creating item attributes\uff1a</strong><br>Customize item attributes to create your exclusive equipment<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/da0836b4785fb77a04903dc78ef44bed.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong>Mainline tasks\uff1a</strong><br>Experience rich and exciting storylines in the small town[/list]<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/59d24c4f265088b58ccd781b16316872.poster.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/59d24c4f265088b58ccd781b16316872.webm?t=1714724429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/59d24c4f265088b58ccd781b16316872.mp4?t=1714724429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Boredom survivor is a &quot;boring&quot; survivor+role-playing game<br>You can pick up handy weapons in the game and use technology and magic to repel monster invasions!<br>Gain growth through battles and collect materials for crafting.<br>You can also explore the secrets of the small town during battles. Can you discover the truth of the small town as a warrior?<br><br>Excellent gameplay experience+extremely complex and diverse skills/items/growth system!<br><br>Multiple adventure professions to choose from, each with its own unique combat style and growth path!<br><br>Dozens of distinctive combat skills, each with a unique strategic advantage, use your understanding to form the strongest combination!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/272e44c9320ad80b69d733ff1c2de064.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=358 /></span><br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><strong>Multiple roles\uff1a</strong><br>Different characters carry different talents, and combine skills and equipment according to your preferences<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/d10022560435cda8f8ab2abb9c3e78bc.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong>Equipment system\uff1a</strong><br>Randomly obtain equipment of various qualities from monsters<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/3cfee4b0afe83fd9632dfc6372df4097.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong>set bonuses\uff1a</strong><br>Collect a large number of different sets to achieve powerful effects<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/1fbd40959a9f7d003ae1281d546ef431.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong>Creating item attributes\uff1a</strong><br>Customize item attributes to create your exclusive equipment<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/da0836b4785fb77a04903dc78ef44bed.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong>Mainline tasks\uff1a</strong><br>Experience rich and exciting storylines in the small town[/list]<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/59d24c4f265088b58ccd781b16316872.poster.avif?t=1714724429\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/59d24c4f265088b58ccd781b16316872.webm?t=1714724429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906830/extras/59d24c4f265088b58ccd781b16316872.mp4?t=1714724429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "What can you do in this survivor-style game? Switch between different characters, craft various types of equipment, collect sets, choose from a variety of skills, and create your own combat style! And who knows, perhaps there are some secrets waiting to be discovered in this dull town.",
